<label class="header-type">
  ZONING MAP INDEX
</label>
<h1 class="header-large uppercase">
  {{this.displayName}}
</h1>

<div class="external-map-links">
  <p>
      <a
        href="{{this.model.zoningmapurl}}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        <FaIcon @icon="external-link-alt" />
        View Zoning Map <small>(PDF)</small>
      </a>
  </p>

  <p>
      <a
        href="{{this.model.historicalmapurl}}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        title="This PDF document contains all adopted zoning section maps since 1961 that were either printed in the Zoning Resolution or posted on DCP's website."
      >
        <FaIcon @icon="external-link-alt" />
        Historical Map <small>(PDF)</small>
      </a>
  </p>

  <p>
      <a
        href="{{this.model.updatelogurl}}"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        title="The Zoning Map Change Log is a record of the most recent zoning changes approved by City Council."
      >
        <FaIcon @icon="external-link-alt" />
        Zoning Map Changelog <small>(PDF)</small>
      </a>
  </p>
</div>


<p>O LoteDiretor organiza índices territoriais para localizar e interpretar áreas de planejamento no mapa.</p>

<p>
    <a
      href="https://s-media.nyc.gov/agencies/dcp/assets/files/AE/about-zoning-maps.pdf"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <FaIcon @icon="external-link-alt" />
      Learn more&hellip; <small>(PDF)</small>
    </a>
</p>

{{yield}}
